{"Color vision":"Värinäkö","Every goal met. The neighborhood noticed.":"Jokainen tavoite saavutettiin. Naapurusto huomasi.","Market Manager — an original neighborhood market game. Plays offline.":"Market Manager — alkuperäinen lähikauppapeli. Toistaa offline-tilassa.","Neighborhood Favorite":"Lähialueen suosikki","Harbor Lane":"Harbour Lane","Gamepad d-pad / left stick":"Peliohjaimen d-pad / vasen tikku","Gamepad A":"Peliohjain A","Gamepad B":"Peliohjain B","Gamepad Start":"Peliohjaimen käynnistys","Gamepad Y":"Peliohjain Y","Tap / click a shelf":"Napauta/napsauta hyllyä","restock it (or open its actions)":"lisää sen varastoon (tai avaa sen toiminnot)","Tap / click a checkout":"Napauta / napsauta kassaa","serve the next guest":"palvella seuraavaa vierasta","move focus between market actions":"siirtää painopistettä markkinatoimien välillä","Enter / Space":"Enter / välilyönti","confirm the focused action":"vahvistaa kohdistetun toiminnan","hint":"vihje","undo (Practice only)":"kumoa (vain harjoitus)","reset camera":"nollaa kamera","pause / close panel":"tauko/sulje paneeli","move focus":"siirrä tarkennusta","confirm":"vahvista","cancel / close":"peruuttaa / sulkea","pause":"tauko","new market in {h}h {m}m":"uudet markkinat alueella {h}h {m}m","Mastery stage":"Mestaruusvaihe","Platform leaderboard":"Alustan tulostaulu","Top shifts":"Huippuvuorot","Go":"Aloita","Something went wrong repeatedly — the shift was paused":"Jotain meni pieleen toistuvasti - vuoro keskeytettiin","Guest served +{n}":"Vieraspalvelu +{n}","A guest left angry":"Vieras lähti vihaisena","A guest found empty shelves":"Vieras löysi tyhjät hyllyt","Undone":"Kumottu","No actions available right now":"Ei toimintoja saatavilla juuri nyt","Serve checkout {n} — guests are waiting":"Tarjoile kassalle {n} – vieraat odottavat","Restock shelf {n}":"Varastohylly {n}","You can afford to unlock a department":"Sinulla on varaa avata osasto","Hire a cashier from the staff panel":"Palkkaa kassan henkilöstöpaneelista"